# Bolt Bend (ruling 2024-11-08): "If there are no legal targets to choose from, the target isn't changed." Bot1's Blossoming
# Defense ("target creature you control") on its only creature, the Ornithopter, has no other legal target - Bot2's creature
# is not one Bot1 controls - so Bot2's Bolt Bend (full cost, four Moxen) changes nothing and the Defense resolves on the
# Ornithopter, which is a 2/4 with hexproof. Bot2's own Ornithopter is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Blossoming Defense
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Bolt Bend
Ornithopter
Island x14

